text":"居庸一带雨馀青，历鹿车声久厌听。\n梦到江南旧游处，钓鱼矶畔柳风停。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8677,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"又次韵述怀见答 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"菟裘无地可田园，犹是栖栖择木猿。\n昨夜洛阳风雪甚，袁安依旧卧衡门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8678,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"又次韵述怀见答 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"虚庭罗雀砌生苔，紫燕穿帘似见猜。\n开尽碧桃凝伫久，麻姑书信几时来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8679,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王君冕尝于长安城东出南头第一门之北凿牖穴号归云洞二首（门即青门庙记又名青绮门） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"青绮门边有穴居，窈无窗户与阶除。\n暂时收住为霖气，不逐狂风谩卷舒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8680,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王君冕尝于长安城东出南头第一门之北凿牖穴号归云洞二首（门即青门庙记又名青绮门） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"苍狗白衣多变幻，土屋深沉藏不散。\n神龙有时飞汗漫，犹可相从雨霄汉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8681,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"抚州李氏种桃亭","author":"宋褧","text":"瑶池阿母杳无踪，结实开花怅望中。\n何似君家亭子上，一年一度看春风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8682,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠辛瑞卿（名居祯尝质物于某氏私库误赎得玉带金器不受而返之时人义其事）","author":"宋褧","text":"之子轻财能好义，事如行道不拾遗。\n试从人物观此世，有似开元贞观时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8683,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夏日家食偶成","author":"宋褧","text":"晓日荒荒帘影低，炊烟浮动孟光衣。\n苍蝇大是无知物，苜蓿盘边亦乱飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8684,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"顺州会曹元宾尚书贻诗二绝因和其韵（巡历京畿东道） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"三十昂藏试省闱，回思金榜挂名时。\n府公幸遇张京兆，到处逢人说项斯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8685,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"顺州会曹元宾尚书贻诗二绝因和其韵（巡历京畿东道） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"王事那能计苦寒，客窗灯火夜阑珊。\n谁人解得尚书乐，不戴朝冠戴道冠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8686,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十二月十五日香河偶成","author":"宋褧","text":"朔风初定晓霜晴，独坐寒厅日转盈。\n怪得无人来诉讼，羽林猎骑尽还营。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8687,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"檀州之平谷道中口号（赈饥东道）","author":"宋褧","text":"村垣儿女可怜生，满髻花枝弄晚晴。\n放下秋千争见笑，雨中骑马过清明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8688,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]